---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="SoftenerIndex is Bob Molina’s editorial hard-water directory — not a dealership."
  canonicalPath="/about"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="kicker">About</p>
      <h1>{site.name}</h1>
      <p class="lede">{site.tagline}</p>
      <p>
        SoftenerIndex is published by {site.publisher}. It is a static, editorial directory for
        people comparing water-softener quotes: what a fair quote includes, how salt-based and
        salt-free products differ, and how to use public water reports and license lookups in a
        given city.
      </p>
      <p>
        It is not a plumbing company, not a financing desk, and not a door-to-door sales funnel.
        If a hardness, price, or installer figure is missing, that is because it has not been
        sourced yet — not because we filled the gap with a guess.
      </p>
      <p>
        Editorial standards live on the <a href="/methodology">numbers policy</a> page. Affiliate
        hops use stable <a href="/disclosure"><code>/go</code> paths</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
